        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/e4e48d152c176a62e345835293caaa28.avif?t=1754618874\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this lonely isle shrouded in eternal fog, time itself seems to condense into damp droplets of mist, and every whispering breeze carries fragments of untold secrets. You awaken, cast ashore by unknown forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an action role-playing game where survival and discovery intertwine. As time flows, hunger gnaws at you, demanding careful management of scarce resources. Skills must be wielded wisely, for every choice carries weight—even combat is a measured risk, as fallen foes do not respawn, altering the island’s fragile balance forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The indigenous people, their voices woven with cryptic wisdom, speak of a forgotten deity who governs time itself. Through their fragmented tales and perilous quests, you must piece together the island’s enigma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you venture, the more the island bends around you—memories replay, paths rewrite themselves, and the line between past and present blurs. Will you unravel the threads of time, or become another echo lost in the mist?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/e49cdd055977c5714f48698e76b19b6f.poster.avif?t=1754618874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/e49cdd055977c5714f48698e76b19b6f.webm?t=1754618874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/e49cdd055977c5714f48698e76b19b6f.mp4?t=1754618874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the flow of time: Slow your enemies' movements to gain tactical advantages in combat or evasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/7c066a9956979bde155e86f95e79d1fb.poster.avif?t=1754618874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/7c066a9956979bde155e86f95e79d1fb.webm?t=1754618874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/7c066a9956979bde155e86f95e79d1fb.mp4?t=1754618874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wield the power of frost and flame, unleashing devastating damage upon your enemies.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/65a884f5381d516275dbc5c264528eea.poster.avif?t=1754618874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/65a884f5381d516275dbc5c264528eea.webm?t=1754618874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/65a884f5381d516275dbc5c264528eea.mp4?t=1754618874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mightiest techniques appear deceptively simple. Each movement, forged in endless combat, flows seamlessly between offense and evasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a struggling indie dev, and this game represents the absolute limit of my current abilities.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/e4e48d152c176a62e345835293caaa28.avif?t=1754618874\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this lonely isle shrouded in eternal fog, time itself seems to condense into damp droplets of mist, and every whispering breeze carries fragments of untold secrets. You awaken, cast ashore by unknown forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an action role-playing game where survival and discovery intertwine. As time flows, hunger gnaws at you, demanding careful management of scarce resources. Skills must be wielded wisely, for every choice carries weight—even combat is a measured risk, as fallen foes do not respawn, altering the island’s fragile balance forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The indigenous people, their voices woven with cryptic wisdom, speak of a forgotten deity who governs time itself. Through their fragmented tales and perilous quests, you must piece together the island’s enigma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you venture, the more the island bends around you—memories replay, paths rewrite themselves, and the line between past and present blurs. Will you unravel the threads of time, or become another echo lost in the mist?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/e49cdd055977c5714f48698e76b19b6f.poster.avif?t=1754618874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/e49cdd055977c5714f48698e76b19b6f.webm?t=1754618874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/e49cdd055977c5714f48698e76b19b6f.mp4?t=1754618874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the flow of time: Slow your enemies' movements to gain tactical advantages in combat or evasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/7c066a9956979bde155e86f95e79d1fb.poster.avif?t=1754618874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/7c066a9956979bde155e86f95e79d1fb.webm?t=1754618874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/7c066a9956979bde155e86f95e79d1fb.mp4?t=1754618874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wield the power of frost and flame, unleashing devastating damage upon your enemies.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/65a884f5381d516275dbc5c264528eea.poster.avif?t=1754618874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/65a884f5381d516275dbc5c264528eea.webm?t=1754618874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873620/extras/65a884f5381d516275dbc5c264528eea.mp4?t=1754618874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mightiest techniques appear deceptively simple. Each movement, forged in endless combat, flows seamlessly between offense and evasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a struggling indie dev, and this game represents the absolute limit of my current abilities.</p>",
